        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Kwikset 802CE, Chelsea Dummy Cylinder Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis simple Chelsea handle features oval mounts and classic two piece design. It will look great for traditional homes. Double cylinder is operated by key outside, and key inside. This Kwikset 802CE Handleset has solid brass construction and is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Cylinder Handleset:</b> is non-functional. Just for looks, it is used on inactive doors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/chelsea-single-cylinder-handleset-kwikset-800ce\"><b>Chelsea Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> for the Two Piece Chelsea Dummy Cylinder Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Polymer coating.</li>\r\n<li>Concealed screw mounting.</li>\r\n<li>Solid forged brass with solid brass construction.</li>\r\n<li>Easy installation.</li>\r\n<li><b>10 Year Finish Warranty.</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 802CE Oval Chelsea Door Entry Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 2-5/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Deadbolt to Center of Top Plate: 5-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center of Latch to Center of Bottom Plate: 9-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Cross Bore: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: please specify</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis handleset is customisable with a huge selection of interior trim knobs and levers and additional finish color options just <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> for all the options! \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the outside handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
