                "description": "Kwikset 802CE Chelsea Dummy Cylinder Handleset - This simple Chelsea handle features oval mounts and classic two piece design. It will look great for traditional homes. Double cylinder is operated by key outside, and key inside.  This Kwikset 802CE Handleset has solid brass construction and is backed by a lifetime mechanical warranty.",
